        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You toss a handful of fragments from used spell gems forward through a tech rune you've drawn in the air, turning them into raw magical energy and shooting that energy forward in a beam. Allies in the area gain 6d6 temporary Hit Points for 1 minute. Enemies in the area take 6d6 force damage and must attempt a Reflex save. If a creature is moved as a result of their saving throw, you determine if they're pushed directly away from you or pulled directly toward you by this forced movement.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage and is moved 5 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is moved 10 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage and is moved 15 feet.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The temporary Hit Points and the force damage both increase by 1d6.</p>"
